    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d156">

                <pb facs="0139" n="119" sameAs="frus:frus1864p3/pg119"/>

                <head>Mr. Dayton to Mr.
                        Seward</head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#float-left">No. 499.]</seg>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps">Paris,</hi></placeName>
                        <date calendar="gregorian" when="1864-06-30"><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >June</hi> 30, 1864.</date></dateline></opener>
                <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">Sir</hi>: Upon the suggestions of Captain Winslow,
                    now in Paris, I have written a letter to the minister of marine, expressing my
                    thanks and high appreciation of the humanity and kindness shown to the wounded
                    at Cherbourg by the surgeon and provost surgeon of the navy hospital at that
                    port. Enclosed I send you a copy of the letter.</p>
                <p>I am, sir, your obedient servant,</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>WM. L DAYTON.</signed></closer>
                <postscript>
                    <p>Hon. <hi rendition="#small-caps">William H. Seward</hi>
                        <hi rendition="#italic">Secretary of State, &amp;c., &amp;c.,
                        &amp;c.</hi></p>
                </postscript>


                <xi:include href="d156-a1.xml" xpointer="d156-a1"/>
